title: "USPS ZIP Locale Detail mirror (JSON, CSV, SQLite)"
abstract: >-
  An auto-updated, free mirror of the USPS PostalPro ZIP Locale Detail dataset.
  Published as JSON, CSV, and SQLite with per-state slices, change sets, and
  provenance metadata. Updated daily via GitHub Actions.
